---
description: Prevent excessive delegation, recursive agents, and unnecessary Sol usage.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Delegation budget
For one user task, use at most one sol-planner, one initial sol-reviewer, one
additional sol-reviewer after material blocking fixes, and one luna-log-analyst
per distinct log set. Subagents must not invoke other subagents. The parent
agent owns implementation, validation, and reporting.
